  "word_count": 1118,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n# Home\n\n\n\n# General Dentist - Los Angeles, CA\n\n\n\n## An innovative, modern dental and implantology center\n\n\nEnjoy a unique all in one dental clinic, where you can receive all aspects of dental care under one roof. Our patients' comfort, care, and service come first.\n\n\n### Technology, Passion And Care.\n\n\nGet a Sneak Peek\n\nMeet The Doctors\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nOur Reviews\n\n\n### What to expect\n\n\nFrom our Yomi® robot to our 3D printer, our investment in technology results in a happier experience for you! Dr. Barriere is committed to continuing his education, so you know you’ll be getting top-notch dental treatment from an expert with more than a decade of experience. We even offer same-day appointments for dental emergencies!\n\n\n### Meet the Doctors\n\n\nDr. Tony Barriere is an expert in dental implants and cosmetic dentistry. He has completed more than 1,000 hours of continuing education training, and he prides himself on providing the highest standard of care and top-of-the-line materials for his patients. He completed his dental training at The Ohio State University College of Dentistry, including a yearlong surgical residency at NYU Langone Hospital. Dr. Barriere is a member of the American Academy of Cosmetic Dentistry, the American Academy of Implant Dentistry, and the American Dental Association.\n\nDr. Tony BarriereRead More\n\n\n### Smile Gallery\n\n\nOur team is committed to making your dental care affordable and comfortable, regardless of whether you’re here for full mouth dental implants or a root canal. We partner with you to treat your needs, see some of the patients we’ve helped!\n\nView More\n\n\n### What Our Patients Are Saying\n\n\nPeter Chang\n\n\n\nRead More\n\n\"Dr. Barriere is a dentist who see's a long term vision for my dental health. He's on my team advising me on my behalf instead of just someone I visit for procedures.\"\n\nJoshua Jonah Fischman\n\n\"Dr. Tony is a skilled and very knowledgeable dentist. He and his office staff are also extremely friendly, which makes them feel like family and West LA Implants feel like home. I had a crown put in by Dr. Tony that was done expertly and will be going back next week for my second cleaning with West LA Implants. I wouldn't consider going anywhere else!\"\n\nAnnie Gigliotti\n\n\"I actually look forward in going to the dentist because of this team! Dr B is comprehensive & pragmatic in his medical approach. The hygienist is the most gentle & proficient on the west side. Lastly, the front desk is incredibly organized, compassionate and professional. Dont miss out on this experience for your dental health!\"\n\nMike Hascats\n\n\"I got an implant years ago from a different dentist. I am currently driving from Central California to West LA Implants to get an implant. I am half done with the process. Dr. Tony Barriere is a really nice guy. He is very careful with his implant technique. He makes sure he does not drill into the sinus cavity. He makes sure the implant has plenty of time to heal into the jawbone. The implant was placed well. I am confident he will do a good job with the implant crown.\"\n\nRead Our Google Reviews\n\nView More Stories\n\nCrowns & Dental Implants\n\nFull Mouth Reconstruction\n\n\n### Top-of-the-Line Technology.\n\n\n\n### Superior Care.\n\n\nWhether you’re looking for full arch dental implants, veneers, crowns or wisdom teeth extractions, Dr. Barriere and his team of experts are here in Los Angeles, CA to help you achieve your best smile. From our new Yomi robot to our 3D printer and cone-beam computed tomography (CBCT) scanner, our team is trained in the most up-to-date technology, so we can provide you with the most effective treatment. We also offer oral surgeries such as bone grafting, full mouth reconstruction, sinus lift, removal of impacted canines, and ridge augmentation.\n\nWhy Choose Us?\n\nWelcome to West LA Implants\n\n\n## Our First-Class Services\n\n\n\n#### Full Mouth Dental Implants\n\n\nIf you have a lot of missing or failing teeth, you may want to consider full arch dental implants. These permanent teeth replacements are surgically implanted to four or more posts in your jawbone, completely restoring your smile and nearly all of your biting and chewing power. By creating chrome guides for dental implant surgery, Dr. Barriere can provide faster, more efficient surgery and quicker recovery times.\n\n\n#### Cosmetic Dentistry\n\n\nWhether you need crowns, veneers, Lumineers® or teeth whitening, West LA Implants is proud to provide many forms of cosmetic dentistry. Each treatment is custom crafted to your specific needs, so your smile makeover will be as unique as you are!\n\n\n#### Wisdom Teeth Extraction\n\n\nAre your wisdom teeth becoming impacted? Have they just started to grow in, or have they been bothering you for years? No matter your situation, you deserve to live your life free of pain, and Dr. Barriere has more than a decade of experience removing wisdom teeth in Los Angeles.\n\n\n#### Sedation Dentistry\n\n\nAlmost every patient we see experiences some degree of dental anxiety. We offer sedation services to our patients help them combat the fear that often is associated with a trip the dentist and to help them get the care they need.\n\n\n## Our Patients tell the story best\n\n\n\n##### \"Full Arch All-On-4 Gave Me My Confidence Back!\"\n\n\n\n##### Leslie - Full Arch All-On-4\n\n\n\n##### \"I Felt Like The Old Me Because Of My Crowns & Dental Implants\"\n\n\n\n##### Emily - Crowns & Dental Implants\n\n\n\n##### \"I Have Teeth Again Thanks To My Full Mouth Reconstruction!\"\n\n\n\n##### Michael - Full Mouth Reconstruction\n\n\n\n## Discover the Difference.\n\n\nSchedule your first appointment today!\n\nCall Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
